  "body": "Followup to #9627 for APIs defined in https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-doc/pull/2858\r\n\r\nWe're aiming to implement this no sooner than the first release in August. By the calendar, that should be Synapse ~~1.38~~ 1.40. Thus, we can implement any time after ~~1.37~~ 1.39 has branched.\r\n\r\nBlockers:\r\n\r\n- [x] Synapse ~~1.37~~ 1.39 has been branched\r\n- [x] https://github.com/vector-im/element-ios/issues/4362\r\n\r\nTasks:\r\n\r\n- [x] Notify client teams of impending change and get sign-off\r\n  - [x] Element iOS\r\n  - [x] Element Android\r\n  - [x] Element Web\r\n- [ ] Disable experimental flag on matrix.org\r\n- [ ] ~~Monitor for a few days~~\r\n- [x] Remove code from `develop`",
